<title>USA: Performance Food buys distributor.</title>
<headline>Performance Food buys distributor.</headline>
<dateline>RICHMOND, Va. 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Performance Food Group Co said Friday it has acquired the assets of Tenneva Foodservice Inc, a privately-owned food distributor based in Briston, Va.</p>
<p>Terms of the deal were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Michael Gray, president and chief operating officer of Performance Food, said the acquired business have annual sales of about $8.0 million.</p>
<p>Performance Food had net sales of $784 million in 1996.</p>
</text>
